{
  "title": "Jagged Citrusy Uruguayan Millet Pilaf",
  "description": "This Uruguayan dish is a citrusy and energizing pilaf featuring millet, with a shio-cure that adds a burst of flavor, all made in a traditional kadhai vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Uruguayan",
